BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (release, employment selection, coverage determinations, and legal conclusions. When a connector fails or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (an output cannot be validated, the fallback should be a labeled manual queue rather than silent completion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (A supervisor must be able to pause writes, inspect pending work, and replay safe operations without) Tj ET
